# Downloaded models, upstream repositories, and runtime state.
# These are anchored to the repository root on purpose: an unanchored
# `models/` also matches src/trace/vendor/cupmem_official/models/, which is
# part of the commit-pinned upstream tree and must stay tracked.
/models/
